HTTP/1.0 503 Service Unavailable
Cache-Control: no-cache
Connection: close
Content-Type: text/html

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Service Unavailable</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #343a40;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0; 
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .main-message {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #333;
        }
        .sub-message {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .help-box {
            background-color: #f1f3f5;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .help-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #444;
        }
        .cluster-info {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: #aaa;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="main-message">Service Unavailable</h1>
        <p class="sub-message">The server is currently unable to handle the request due to a temporary overload or maintenance. Please try again later.</p>
        
        <div class="help-box">
            <p class="help-title">What you can do</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Wait a few minutes and refresh the page</li>
                <li>Check your network connection</li>
                <li>Contact the website administrator if the problem persists</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>